{{Quote|Grants spider-like abilities, including web attacks and agility.|Shop}}
'''Spider''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|1,500,000}} or {{Robux|1,800}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]]. 

Spider grants the user the ability to control and manipulate strings, similar to a spider’s web. The user can swing through the air, slash enemies with sharp strings, summon spiky silk, and throw fiery strings that damage opponents.  

==Awakening==
Spider costs a total of {{Fragment|17,300}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]].

"The Spider" [[Titles|title]] #036 will be granted upon awakening at least one move of this fruit.

