==Trivia==
* Spider is used by [[Swan]] and [[Don Swan]], both having unique versions of Spiders' moves.
* Spider was reworked in [[Updates/19|Update 19]], being renamed from String to Spider alongside changing most of its abilities, with the exception of awakened [X] and [Z].
** For example, {{Ability|F}} is actually the pre-rework awakened String's {{Ability|F|1}}.
* Spider's {{Ability|Z}} shares sound effects with [[Cyborg#Version 4|Cyborg V4's]] Super Jump.
* Most players that use Spider in PvP often choose to use Unawakened '''[C] Over-Heated Sniper''' instead of the Awakened version '''[C] Eternal White''', due to its capability to snipe other players and deal damage instantly. 

